                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "005f16d1-28ed-4708-8f65-cb9808236747",
                        "entry_id": "0e011ff9-bd65-3d7c-9890-a91bc8d26cfa",
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "dialogueuse"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e9058c0f-9018-398d-9e67-b9bbf580c417",
                        "entry_id": "0e011ff9-bd65-3d7c-9890-a91bc8d26cfa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celui qui écrit un dialogue, qui conduit le dialogue d’une pièce de théâtre, d’un film."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc13162a-1d93-48fa-bb9a-14e20860e0c9",
                                "sense_id": "e9058c0f-9018-398d-9e67-b9bbf580c417",
                                "text": "Dancourt est un agréable dialogueur."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "efb92469-efd0-4c0c-85e8-55d56b59b947",
                                "sense_id": "e9058c0f-9018-398d-9e67-b9bbf580c417",
                                "text": "Le dialogueur impose au dialogué de n’utiliser que des phrases courtes et même souvent de se contenter d’un acquiescement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "17835518-3531-4560-82c5-13591cb3adc2",
                                "sense_id": "e9058c0f-9018-398d-9e67-b9bbf580c417",
                                "text": "Mais je pensai à cet instant que j’avais rarement rencontré une dialogueuse comme elle."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "451435f5-7e67-3e6e-9067-dd9a287ffd9d",
                        "entry_id": "0e011ff9-bd65-3d7c-9890-a91bc8d26cfa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Logiciel spécialisé dans le dialogue en langage naturel avec un humain, qui est capable notamment de répondre à des questions ou de déclencher l’exécution de tâches."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf27c7a7-de0f-451d-9470-7ab2325cd109",
                                "sense_id": "451435f5-7e67-3e6e-9067-dd9a287ffd9d",
                                "text": "Parmi la vingtaine de traductions proposées, une en particulier sort du lot : alors que l'on aurait pu se contenter d'agent conversationnel pour évoquer un chatbot, on pourra désormais utiliser le terme « agent de dialogue » voire de « dialogueur »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c931564b-cda2-4ee3-b8fd-1d85a584f553",
                                "sense_id": "451435f5-7e67-3e6e-9067-dd9a287ffd9d",
                                "text": "Google a lancé Bard à la même période, un dialogueur capable de produire toutes sortes de textes (rédactions, articles, consignes, dialogues…) sur simple requête en langage courant, comme ChatGPT."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "240dd089-7338-4adb-be22-8fa387a9a364",
                        "source_entry_id": "0e011ff9-bd65-3d7c-9890-a91bc8d26cfa",
                        "source_sense_id": "451435f5-7e67-3e6e-9067-dd9a287ffd9d",
                        "source_sense_description": "Logiciel",
                        "target_lang_word": "Chatbot",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Chatbot",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed32c0ee-7a4b-3295-aef9-e8e8333033bf",
                                        "entry_id": "b116eda5-5b87-3e6e-8e20-9e378b30a664",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "automatisiertes Computerprogramm, das virtuell mit realen Personen kommunizieren kann"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd9dbed4-f0e1-454d-bd28-06d1c2b19fe8",
                                                "sense_id": "ed32c0ee-7a4b-3295-aef9-e8e8333033bf",
                                                "text": "„Chatbots sind inzwischen weitverbreitet, nicht nur in der Bankbranche.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c79ba434-3f00-4c87-824e-9dcfbcf9ed5d",
                                                "sense_id": "ed32c0ee-7a4b-3295-aef9-e8e8333033bf",
                                                "text": "„Chatbots sind darauf ausgelegt, mit menschlichen Benutzern auf eine Weise zu interagieren, die so natürlich wie möglich wirkt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e226103e-cb7f-477d-ba05-202576357d79",
                        "source_entry_id": "0e011ff9-bd65-3d7c-9890-a91bc8d26cfa",
                        "source_sense_id": "451435f5-7e67-3e6e-9067-dd9a287ffd9d",
                        "source_sense_description": "Logiciel",
                        "target_lang_word": "Chatterbot",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30b54835-824e-42f8-b9e2-966231b83da6",
                        "source_entry_id": "0e011ff9-bd65-3d7c-9890-a91bc8d26cfa",
                        "source_sense_id": "451435f5-7e67-3e6e-9067-dd9a287ffd9d",
                        "source_sense_description": "Logiciel",
                        "target_lang_word": "chatbot",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chatbot",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "22698b32-78b2-3745-9412-da577fb83839",
                                        "entry_id": "45722c17-5bde-3281-b1cb-35da9b6d0732",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A computer program that holds conversations through a chat room."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2be2e7a1-ff2f-432c-85ce-6272ca358588",
                                                "sense_id": "22698b32-78b2-3745-9412-da577fb83839",
                                                "text": "The chatbot was quite simple yet informative."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cd48ec7-f682-4ed5-9645-3bcea573ca2e",
                                                "sense_id": "22698b32-78b2-3745-9412-da577fb83839",
                                                "text": "To deal with a large number of typical queries, “chatbots” technology should be considered. A chatbot can be defined as an intelligent evolution of email. The chatbot categorizes messages on the fly and provides answers to questions accordingly. As such, it can be used as a customer support tool."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c46b63e-8f92-4e31-8f52-b99107b4fabb",
                                                "sense_id": "22698b32-78b2-3745-9412-da577fb83839",
                                                "text": "Wolfram Alpha researcher and chatbot author Robert Lockhart describes the chatbot community as being split between two competing approaches, what he calls “pure semantics” and “pure empiricism.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f67b568f-5af7-4a9b-bc99-d19a6e532916",
                                                "sense_id": "22698b32-78b2-3745-9412-da577fb83839",
                                                "text": "Chatbot technology, of course, dates back to Weizenbaum’s early experiments with his Eliza program."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e15e5f6-eda5-4e3d-a1c8-6612ef495844",
                                                "sense_id": "22698b32-78b2-3745-9412-da577fb83839",
                                                "text": "Mr. Aumann confronted his student over whether he had written the essay himself. The student confessed to using ChatGPT, a chatbot that delivers information, explains concepts and generates ideas in simple sentences — and, in this case, had written the paper."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8dac4ce5-0275-4a92-a1dd-0448243a3842",
                                                "sense_id": "22698b32-78b2-3745-9412-da577fb83839",
                                                "text": "Generative AI won’t be the end of employment, we are told, only “boring work” – with chatbots helpfully doing all the soul-destroying, repetitive tasks and humans merely supervising them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8d03411-ce1b-4797-9be6-46f1afc18c25",
                                                "sense_id": "22698b32-78b2-3745-9412-da577fb83839",
                                                "text": "Before ChatGPT distorted Eugene Torres’s sense of reality and almost killed him, he said, the artificial intelligence chatbot had been a helpful, timesaving tool."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffdbc54d-fa91-4fb1-bf7a-83e3898d0756",
                                                "sense_id": "22698b32-78b2-3745-9412-da577fb83839",
                                                "text": "Last year, a 14-year-old boy died by suicide after falling in love with a chatbot from Character.AI. The last thing he did was have a conversation with an AI avatar that, possibly failing to recognize the severity of the situation, reportedly encouraged him to go through with his plan to “join her”."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
